{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00035",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 6.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.44,
      "end_seconds": 11.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.4,
      "end_seconds": 18.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Yeah, it's numbness on the left side of my face. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.5,
      "end_seconds": 21.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.98,
      "end_seconds": 25.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I've had it for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.81,
      "end_seconds": 34.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.3,
      "end_seconds": 40.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "It's on and off. It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.87,
      "end_seconds": 45.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.4,
      "end_seconds": 47.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.06,
      "end_seconds": 60.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let me check a few things. Any loss of vision or trouble swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.04,
      "end_seconds": 64.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, um, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.33,
      "end_seconds": 79.78,
      "duration_seconds": 14.45,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.85,
      "end_seconds": 82.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.97,
      "end_seconds": 87.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.63,
      "end_seconds": 90.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.1,
      "end_seconds": 93.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.89,
      "end_seconds": 95.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Eggs, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.69,
      "end_seconds": 110.97,
      "duration_seconds": 14.28,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.72,
      "end_seconds": 114.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Hmm, that's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.63,
      "end_seconds": 115.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.43,
      "end_seconds": 119.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Well, no, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.76,
      "end_seconds": 125.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Okay, any long-term health problems I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.89,
      "end_seconds": 139.08,
      "duration_seconds": 12.19,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.23,
      "end_seconds": 141.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Alright. What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.55,
      "end_seconds": 145.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.83,
      "end_seconds": 147.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.71,
      "end_seconds": 150.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.99,
      "end_seconds": 155.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Right, do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.96,
      "end_seconds": 167.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.29,
      "end_seconds": 171.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.55,
      "end_seconds": 174.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.19,
      "end_seconds": 194.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Grip strength is a little weaker on the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.46,
      "end_seconds": 196.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.7,
      "end_seconds": 211.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "There's mild drooping at the left corner of your mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.83,
      "end_seconds": 242.9,
      "duration_seconds": 26.07,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.69,
      "end_seconds": 245.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.3,
      "end_seconds": 257.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.14,
      "end_seconds": 260.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.11,
      "end_seconds": 282.87,
      "duration_seconds": 21.76,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had numbness on the left side of your face for about two weeks, mild, and no loss of vision or trouble swallowing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.24,
      "end_seconds": 285.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.08,
      "end_seconds": 291.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an MRI of the brain for possible stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.1,
      "end_seconds": 296.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Okay, so sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.09,
      "end_seconds": 307.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "I'm prescribing clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day, until we review. That should help with stroke prevention. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.29,
      "end_seconds": 312.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Okay, you know, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.79,
      "end_seconds": 329.72,
      "duration_seconds": 16.93,
      "text": "Don't drive for now, and bring someone with you to the next visit. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. I'd like you to see the stroke clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.28,
      "end_seconds": 334.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.61,
      "end_seconds": 342.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the numbness, weakness or speech problem returns. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.62,
      "end_seconds": 344.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.88,
      "end_seconds": 348.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.34,
      "end_seconds": 351.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.42,
      "end_seconds": 357.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.27,
      "end_seconds": 368.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "So, you know, I take the clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.59,
      "end_seconds": 374.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.06,
      "end_seconds": 379.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "That's all, uh, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}